#
# The Python Imaging Library.
# $Id$
#
# IPTC/NAA file handling
#
# history:
# 1995-10-01 fl   Created
# 1998-03-09 fl   Cleaned up and added to PIL
# 2002-06-18 fl   Added getiptcinfo helper
